rence its member to its profile for the email on file, then send a reset link to that address: the Alice, the Bob. None of these 5 streams depend on each other, so run them concurrently. For EVERY item: resolve each target FRESH by chaining through the records at the moment you act — never guess, and never reuse a value you read earlier.",
